# Internal experiment harness — narrow-tracked from 2026-06-01 (P0-prep).
# Track ONLY scripts/ + adapters/; everything else under experiments/ stays OFF git
# (gold answer-key, run artifacts, working notes). Tracking the Evidence-Bundle dir
# experiments/output/regression/ is DEFERRED to a later step — the nested
# experiments/.gitignore also ignores output/, so it cannot be re-included here yet.
experiments/*
!experiments/scripts/
!experiments/adapters/
experiments/annotations/
experiments/systems/
experiments/runs/
experiments/reports/
experiments/output/
experiments/*.md
/scripts/
tobefixed/
